  "summary": {
    "plain": "ZEPLIN-III tested a specific idea (inelastic dark matter) that could reconcile the DAMA signal with null results elsewhere, and left only a small region open.",
    "technical": "Limits on inelastic dark matter from the 2008 run: 63 kg d net exposure in 20-80 keV nuclear recoil, 6 events observed; a small region consistent with the 1.17 ton-yr DAMA modulation signal remains at 90% CL in the mass range 45-60 GeV with a minimum CL of 88%."
  },
  "title": "Limits on inelastic dark matter from ZEPLIN-III",
